            "body": "Yes, that is done with `vim.ui.select`. You can use [`ui_select`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b612a069d1fe99300da43629e0e9c7a1a9b0acda/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1060) override from 'mini.pick'.",
